cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Labour Market Dynamics and Skill Development — Bibliometric Dataset (WoS 623)"
abstract: >
  A dataset of 623 Web of Science–indexed articles published between 1975
  and 2024 at the intersection of labour-market dynamics and skill
  development. Includes raw bibliographic records, descriptive frequency
  tables (authors, affiliations, countries, research areas, annual output),
  keyword co-occurrence network data for 71 keywords grouped in five
  clusters, and country co-authorship network data for 38 countries grouped
  in four clusters. The dataset supports the bibliometric and scientometric
  analysis reported in Bourgou et al. (2026), published in Prosperitas.
